			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1362097">
									

<p>I can change the part about the government easily; I assumed it would be fun not knowing why the O5 council would deny such vital information. I was unsure of that part myself, however, so it's no huge loss. I'll wait and see what others have to say on it before making that move.</p>
<p>I tried to make the object &quot;harmless&quot; (It can deafen and blind people, and it blacks out electronics, but it doesn't have destructive force or continuous lasting radioactive decay). Dr. Wondertainment even recommends safety gear in its operation that would protect the user against harm; what they/he forgot about, of course, were the political and social ramifications of detonating a fake nuclear device.</p>

